{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "action-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1800,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# 动作曲线｜原Montage XYZ与明确Profile模式\n当前普攻原Task／来源 → CMC唯一动作源 → native物理；GA生命周期、Pose与胶囊分责。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|契约与证据]] · [[Movement/结构]] · [[Movement/GGYGO_流程_移动与位移.canvas|主流程]]。原行为整链已验，负向Error保留；网络／完整姿态未验。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-author",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 原资产与离线业务生产\nPyrios原Sequence含累计RootMotion_PosX/Y/Z；Animation依原Montage／FullBody／Main建立不可变来源。\nKevin工具JSON／FBX→归零CV＋派生AS＋业务Profile，保原序列；本轮不重新验Kevin资产状态。\n原曲线唯一来源，缺失明确拒绝，不复制轨迹兜底。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-profile",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 原SourceBinding／业务Profile\n当前普攻：原Montage／Slot／Section／分片元信息，Task提供原实例／位置／固定速率。\n纯求值映射Montage区间，差分原PosXYZ；native动画RootMotion互斥。\nProfile另配累计CV／Duration／Scale，明确服务器地面XY；无错误替代。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## GA／原Task编排\nGA选择Main／End、Slot、PlayRate／Scale，持原资源Handle。\nTask播放／快照＋必需Pose Acquire／Poll；缺声明／原provider失效明确中止原能力。\nMain申请原动作；End Release(Completed)，查询／订阅原Scope合格意图。\nHeld／新Press合格才精确打断，后续原输入恢复WalkRun。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[Animation/结构]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-begin",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## CMC::BeginMontageActionMotion\n原Source／Instance／Position／Rate／Scale → 校验原身份／主段／互斥／有限值，返回Handle或明确失败。\nauthority或原本地autonomous，Walking／NavWalking／Falling。\n捕获入口Actor旋转与MeshScale×业务Scale一次；退自身Stop／TurnBack，挂同一Action RMS。\n兼容BeginActionMotion(Profile,rate)仍服务器地面XY，不替代失败原源。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-sample",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## native RMS PrepareRootMotion\nOriginalMontage：实际sim／tick＋native时间映射原Sequence分片，PosXYZ累计差分。\nActor基准旋转×捕获Scale一次 → WorldDelta／tick → Override XYZ；零位移继续持有，尾帧clamp保留。\n取消IgnoreZ／敏感离地；native Walking／NavWalking／Falling管碰撞、重力、落地。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-clean",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1490,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## End／失败／精确释放\nEnd → Release(原Handle,Completed)，保未消费尾贡献，不盲清Velocity。\n原Scope QualifiedIntent合格 → CancelForMovement仅清原XY，保空气Z／后继；原Input→CMC恢复WalkRun。\n原依赖失败中止自身动作；自然到期／Owner退役清原资源。\nGA退原订阅／Task／Trace；Pose只管身体，普通Release不改后继速度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-scope",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 实际验证与剩余边界\n当前六必要叶3Success／3Fail：两正常End余0.495957／0.498010秒即停并真实Walk／Run；XYZ原生胶囊／碰撞、尾帧／空气Z／后继通过。\n两Pose负向行为PASS各2Error；恢复原断言／两个标记到达，64→48.640→42.988 cm/s native制动、未知RMS拒绝且保资源、Stop资格失效，3Error保留。\nABP已保存ActionPoseSlot(FullBody)／IgnoreRootMotion；Normal01 Main身体Z仅147采样／146种、19.342265～51.118433cm。\nEnd／完整混合、其他角色动作、Cook、HID、完整网络及Player相位未验；旧真实失败不覆盖。\n[[Movement/结构#验收、退役与剩余边界|完整证据]]"
    }
  ],
